{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And they shall minister to him.</b> And what is the ministry?" "<b>And they shall keep his charge.</b> Because the guarding of the Sanctuary is upon him — that no outsider draw near, as it is said ״אַתָּה וּבָנֶיךָ וּבֵית אָבִיךָ אִתָּךְ תִּשְׂאוּ אֶת עֲוֹן הַמִּקְדָּשׁ״ (Numbers 18) — and these Levites assist them; that is the ministry."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:12.203827596Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}